(20, 'Mike Kirk', 'no-replyimpaivy@gmail.com', '89283391428', '3', 'Hi there \r\n \r\nI Just checked your ideacastit.com ranks and saw that your site is trending down for some time. \r\n \r\nIf you are looking for a trend reversal, we have the right solution for you \r\n \r\nWe are offering affordable Content Marketing plans with humanly written SEO content \r\n \r\nFor more information, please check our offers \r\nhttps://www.digital-x-press.com/product/content-marketing/ \r\n \r\nThanks and regards \r\nMike Kirk', 1, '2023-01-03 15:51:18', '2023-01-03 10:51:18'),
(21, 'Peter', 'webdelaware@gmail.com', '7520642898', '3', 'Hi there, I visited your website http://www.ideacastit.com and thought to check if you are looking for web designer or a developer? You don’t need to hire an individual web designer or a web developer. \r\n\r\nWe are a team of 7 covering all skill sets that you may be needing from graphic designing, front end development or back-end development using core PHP/MySQL, CodeIgniter, Laravel and more. We can work on a project-to-project basis be it small or ongoing project.\r\n\r\nOur affordable hourly rate is just between 12 – 18 depending on your skills required. We can negotiate before we kick-start any project. We often encounter reliability issues when it comes to production and support. We work from 9-5 local time. And your team is available on local phone, Skype, Slack, or any project management software you may be using. Communicating with your team should not be a problem as we can do Zoom meetings or talk over a phone locally whenever you need any project to be discussed.\r\n\r\nAnd honestly, we registered firm locally but our development team is based in India working. Yet we work as per our country’s local timings. The payment shall be made locally to our country’s own business bank account. So, no offshore advance payments, we simply start working and you pay to our local bank account once every month. \r\n\r\nAdditionally, we also have our Unlimited World Business Data software for just 25/year. It will collect any kind of business marketing data by category and area in just 5 minutes and export to excel. We can demo you this software as per your convenient time.\r\n\r\nI can call you as per your convenient time and discuss in length on how to start, work flow, communication, deliveries, and payment terms. Should there be a need we shall also signup NDA with you. Please let me know if you have any small projects to start with.\r\nRegards\r\nPeter Patel\r\n+1 567 251 0632 (US) / +44 752 064 2898 (UK)', 1, '2023-01-07 18:15:45', '2023-01-07 13:15:45');

